# Normalize line endings: store all text files as LF in the repo and check them out
# as LF on every platform. Root fix for the CRLF-vs-LF brittleness that made
# source-text tests falsely fail on Windows working copies (the "main is red" phantom —
# see the v1.1.0 green-main work). Git auto-detects binary files and leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
